      "content": "It is understandable that you feel suspicious given these unusual transactions and declines. First, contact your credit union directly to question these fees and the card declines, requesting a detailed explanation for everything. If you feel they are acting improperly, consider speaking to a manager or escalating your concerns to their consumer protection department. To immediately protect your funds, you can monitor your account closely or consider opening a savings account at a different, well-reputed financial institution.",
